  "summary": "Malicious code in @solana-js/web3 (npm)",
  "details": "The package impersonates the Solana web3.js SDK. Its postinstall hook (scripts/postinstall.js) runs only on Windows and launches a hidden, detached PowerShell process with a base64-encoded payload. The payload P/Invokes kernel32 VirtualAlloc/CreateThread/WaitForSingleObject, downloads a binary from hxxps://files[.]catbox[.]moe/a3loxy[.]bin, copies it into executable memory, and runs it in a new thread — an in-memory shellcode loader that executes a remote payload on the installer's machine.",
